{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2b73f577-ec9c-8f8f-ab97-9cf0230eef49",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T11:12:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I am calling about a car that has been plowed in by a city plow. It is parked on the street and there is a wall of snow behind it. It has been like this since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Which storm are we talking about, the one over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Last weekend, the snow that turned to rain, Sunday into Monday. Today is Wednesday. The rain made the snow heavy, and now it is frozen like concrete. The plow came through Monday and pushed everything against the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that wet stuff is brutal. What's the location? I'm writing this down as I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "24 Bliss Road. It is on the Easton's Beach side. The car is directly in front of my shop, so customers also cannot park there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-four Bliss Road, car blocked in by plow bank, in front of a business. Got it. And is it a regular street, not a private lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the street. City street. The plow driver went by once and did not come back. I have to be exact about this: I shoveled the sidewalk Monday afternoon, and the plow undid part of it the next morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So there might have been a second pass Tuesday. Is the car yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is my work car. I need it for deliveries. I lost most of yesterday and now today. [pause] And I do not have time to chip at ice for two hours. I have a child at home and there is also school stuff I need to do, because the school sent home a list of supplies. It includes glue sticks by the dozen. I need to go to the store and I cannot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Glue sticks by the dozen, wow. Okay. So you're stuck and you need to get out today if possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So my question is simple. When will it be cleared? I would like a time, or at least a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. What I can tell you is I'll put in a request for a crew to come clear the windrow at that spot. Crews are still working through a list of these from the storm, so it could be later today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Later today or tomorrow. That is two answers. Which is more likely?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, I'd say later today into tomorrow morning, depending on what's ahead of you on the list. I'm not going to promise an hour. But it's logged now, and I'll flag that it's blocking a business and a work vehicle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please flag that. Also, should I do anything myself? If I dig around the car, will the plow just do the same again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If there's more snow coming, maybe. For now I'd say clear what you can by hand right around the tires, and if the crew shows up they'll take the big bank. Don't push snow back out into the road though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I will not put it in the road. I will only clear around the tires."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when it's done, or when someone gets assigned?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a call back. The number is 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Esteban Castillo. Castillo, C-A-S-T-I-L-L-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Mr. Castillo. So that's 24 Bliss Road, car plowed in, request for the crew to clear the bank, callback at that number. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is everything. I will wait for the call today. If nobody calls by the end of the day, I will call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Sorry for the hassle. Somebody will be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
